    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeMobileObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToMobileObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO ScanAreaForMobileObject\n\tEND\n"
